Subject: [M152] [canvas2d] Obtain PaintCanvas and state after style resolution
 in DrawTextInternal

Original change's description:
> [canvas2d] Obtain PaintCanvas and state after style resolution in DrawTextInternal
>
> BaseRenderingContext2D::DrawTextInternal() currently grabs a raw
> cc::PaintCanvas* pointer via GetOrCreatePaintCanvas() before calling
> AccessFont(), EnsureComputedStyle(), and ToTextDirection().
>
> Because those style-resolving calls can invoke EnsureComputedStyle(), a
> synchronous style recalculation can run scripts and resize or reset the
> canvas, destroying the recorder and invalidating the active PaintCanvas*
> pointer and CanvasRenderingContext2DState reference before drawing.
>
> Move GetOrCreatePaintCanvas() and GetState() in DrawTextInternal() to
> after AccessFont(), EnsureComputedStyle(), and ToTextDirection() have
> completed, and re-fetch GetState() after font resolution in AccessFont()
> and setFont().
>
